@token=COLE_AQUI_O_TOKEN_RETORNADO_POR_1auth.http
@instrumentoId=COLE_AQUI_O_ID_RETORNADO_NO_CADASTRO

# ====================================================================
# 3. INSTRUMENTOS (RF02 a RF05)
# ====================================================================

### Cadastrar instrumento (UC01)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/instrumentos
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "nome": "Jazz Bass Tagima",
  "observacoes": "Comprado usado, cordas novas"
}

###

### Cadastrar um segundo instrumento
POST http://localhost:3000/api/instrumentos
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "nome": "Stratocaster Seizi",
  "favorito": true,
  "atual": true
}

###

### Listar todos os instrumentos
GET http://localhost:3000/api/instrumentos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Listar apenas os ativos (RF02)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/instrumentos?status=ativo
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Listar os vendidos (histórico - RF05)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/instrumentos?status=vendido
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Buscar por id
GET http://localhost:3000/api/instrumentos/{{instrumentoId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Editar instrumento
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/instrumentos/{{instrumentoId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "nome": "Jazz Bass Tagima TW-73",
  "observacoes": "Regulagem feita em 10/2025"
}

###

### Definir como favorito (RF03/UC02 - remove o favorito anterior)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/instrumentos/{{instrumentoId}}/favorito
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Definir como instrumento atual (RF04/UC03)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/instrumentos/{{instrumentoId}}/atual
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Alterar status (RF05/UC04)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/instrumentos/{{instrumentoId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "status": "vendido",
  "statusAlteradoEm": "2026-08-20",
  "observacoes": "Vendido para comprar o baixo novo"
}

###

### Status inválido (deve retornar 400)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/instrumentos/{{instrumentoId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "status": "emprestado"
}

###

### Remover instrumento
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/instrumentos/{{instrumentoId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
